MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: BrittleStar
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 16
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Ring Detonation
    AbilityDescription: 'LT. Eject the support ring and throw it forward (240 u/s on top of your own speed); it detonates
      on touching any mass or a rival hull, or on its 1.1 s fuse, in an ALL-DOMAIN blast (your own and
      your allies'' mass too), then a second wave runs out in the plane of the ring to 2.5x the
      blast''s radius. A rival caught in either is scored on (petals only - nothing is moved). No
      cooldown, only a ring: with a stored crystal charge a new ring is built at once (two in rapid
      succession); without one you fly ringless and modeless until a crystal builds the next. Charge
      is threat - one dial: both blasts'' size x1 -> x1.6 at level 10
      (BrittleStarConfigSO.blastScale), and the rounds'' size x1 -> x1.8 with it
      (projectileScaleMultiplier), the Rolling Thunder persona''s two halves of one idea.'
    Input: 2
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Creation Mode
    AbilityDescription: 'B. The trail becomes a PENTAGON of blocks laid from the ring''s five points, turning with the
      ring''s firing rotation, instead of the single small block from the cockpit. Needs the ring.
      Mass is volume - one dial: the pentagon''s blocks x1 -> x1.8 at level 10
      (BrittleStarConfigSO.creationBlockScale).'
    Input: 7
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Destruction Mode
    AbilityDescription: 'X, and Fire on RT (held). Normal fire is one stream, from the turret the right stick points at
      (the ring turns to bring it round) or the cockpit gun with the stick centred; Destruction Mode
      fires all five turrets with larger rounds. The stick''s deflection opens the spread. Friendly
      fire is on. A round on a rival hull is a scored bullet hit (petals only). Space is reach - one
      dial: the rounds'' flight time, and so their range, x1 -> x1.6 at level 10
      (BrittleStarConfigSO.rangeMultiplier).'
    Input: 8
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Speed Mode
    AbilityDescription: 'A. Ignite every thruster: the hull''s cruise speed x1.6, and the base trail''s spacing stretched
      by the same ratio so production per second does not rise. Needs the ring. A crystal collected
      with a charge already stored is OVERDRIVE - all three modes at once for 6 s. Time is rate - one
      dial: Speed Mode''s multiplier x1.6 -> x2.2 at level 10
      (BrittleStarConfigSO.speedModeMultiplier).'
    Input: 6
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
